WEBVTT

00:04:59.829 --> 00:05:05.246
or what the design of a home might
mean to us in our daily lives.

00:05:05.746 --> 00:05:08.538
Is it fair to say that what you're
talking about is this idea that

00:05:08.538 --> 00:05:11.413
architecture can inspire awe and wonder,

00:05:11.413 --> 00:05:15.996
but it wasn't being used to do something
more sort of practical in that it wasn't

00:05:15.996 --> 00:05:22.454
being used to heal in a much more sort
of humanitarian kind of way?

00:05:22.996 --> 00:05:26.621
Yeah, I think architecture does
do both of those things.

00:05:27.079 --> 00:05:29.746
I think architecture does produce
a sense of wonder,

00:05:29.746 --> 00:05:32.496
but it does more than that. It
affects our daily lives.